CLEARMIND: code, data files and results accompanying the CLEARMIND paper

Copyright (c) 2026 the CLEARMIND authors. All rights reserved.

1. Purpose. These materials (source code, documentation, saved models, data files, results,
   figures and the animation) are published so that readers can inspect the method and check
   the results reported in the paper.

2. What you may do. You may view and download the materials, and run the code to reproduce and
   check the reported results. Citing the paper and its results is welcome.

3. What you may not do without the authors' prior written permission. You may not copy, modify,
   translate or rewrite the code, in whole or in part; use the code, saved models or data files
   in other work; or redistribute or publish the materials or anything derived from them, in
   any form.

4. Notices. Every source file carries a notice that identifies it as part of CLEARMIND. The
   notices must not be removed or altered.

5. No warranty. The materials are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

The folder legacy/ holds an earlier release with its own documentation.
